      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Ajentic-SRE Agent Container\n(Zero-Trust Application Tier)\n\n❌ ZERO Cloud Credentials (AWS/Azure)\n❌ ZERO Kubeconfig / Cluster Keys\n❌ ZERO GitHub Write Tokens\n\n🔑 Holds ONLY: Shared Secret Key\n(ajentic.sidecar.hmac-secret)\n\nComputes SHA-256 HMAC over\nPayload + Timestamp + Nonce",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1712365889,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "text": "Ajentic-SRE Agent Container\n(Zero-Trust Application Tier)\n\n❌ ZERO Cloud Credentials (AWS/Azure)\n❌ ZERO Kubeconfig / Cluster Keys\n❌ ZERO GitHub Write Tokens\n\n🔑 Holds ONLY: Shared Secret Key\n(ajentic.sidecar.hmac-secret)\n\nComputes SHA-256 HMAC over\nPayload + Timestamp + Nonce",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "updated": 1793465439618,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1966403103,
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
