      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Cryptographic Wire Boundary\n(Anti-Replay Verification)\n\nHeaders on HTTP Request:\n• X-Ajentic-Signature: <hex-mac>\n• X-Ajentic-Timestamp: <unix-ms>\n• X-Ajentic-Nonce: <uuid>\n\n🛡️ Replay Protection Rules:\n• Timestamp drift ≤ 30 seconds\n• Nonce cache rejects duplicates\n• Constant-time HMAC comparison",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 419827059,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "text": "Cryptographic Wire Boundary\n(Anti-Replay Verification)\n\nHeaders on HTTP Request:\n• X-Ajentic-Signature: <hex-mac>\n• X-Ajentic-Timestamp: <unix-ms>\n• X-Ajentic-Nonce: <uuid>\n\n🛡️ Replay Protection Rules:\n• Timestamp drift ≤ 30 seconds\n• Nonce cache rejects duplicates\n• Constant-time HMAC comparison",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "updated": 1793465439618,
      "version": 1,
