      "originalText": "Credentialed Sidecar Daemon\n(Isolated Execution Proxy)\n\n✅ Validates HMAC + Freshness\n✅ Injects Target Credentials:\n   - AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY\n   - KUBECONFIG Cluster Context\n   - GITHUB_TOKEN for PR creation\n\n📝 Emits Tamper-Evident Audit Log:\n{timestamp, caller, action, result, traceId}",
